OL,3,ADUP leader 'very sorry' Carla Lockhart
OL,4,Ahas quit the party
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP) leader
OL,7,FGavin Robinson has said he is "very
OL,8,Fsorry" that MP Carla Lockhart has quit
OL,9,Fthe party.
OL,11,FRobinson said he would not be
OL,12,Fcriticising the Upper Bann MP, who left
OL,13,Fthe party on Monday over its response
OL,14,Fto the Drumcree parading dispute, and
OL,15,Fexpressed hope they would continue to
OL,16,Fwork together in the future.
OL,18,FLockhart had been calling for the DUP
OL,19,Fto withdraw Stormont's deputy first
OL,20,Fminister to force Sinn Fein First
OL,21,FMinister Michelle O'Neill from their
OL,22,Fjoint office.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
