OL,3,ADUP leader 'very sorry' Carla Lockhart
OL,4,Ahas quit the party
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on Tuesday, Robinson said the
OL,7,Fdisagreement was over strategy not
OL,8,Fsentiment.
